{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>無論你想增肌、減重、改善睡眠還是建立更健康的生活習慣，Valenta 都能幫你在一處集中管理訓練、飲食、睡眠、水分攝取、體重與每日進度。這款功能全面的健康追蹤 App 正在限時免費，把握機會立即入手。</p>\n\n<h2>核心功能一次掌握</h2>\n<p>Valenta 提供簡潔直觀的介面，讓你輕鬆記錄與分析各項健康數據。在訓練方面，你可以自訂健身計劃、記錄每組動作與次數，並追蹤跑步表現。飲食追蹤則支援條碼掃描與營養素（蛋白質、碳水化合物、脂肪）輸入，方便你掌握每日熱量。此外，睡眠與喝水記錄也能幫助你建立更規律的作息與補水習慣，全面提升生活品質。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-132-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-133-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-134-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-135-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-136-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-137-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：valenta: health tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-22T13:39:15.371832+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}